        "id": "68557ac667eb2a70272f48c6",
        "label": "Good",
        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 8,
        "text": "Overall, the property was great as far as size and layout. It is convenient to the community pool. It is a short golf cart ride to the beach but you do have to cross busy Hwy 98 to get to it. The main TV did not work and that was communicated to us up front but because of issues with the owner purchasing a home warranty on the TV, it could not be replaced while we were there so that was frustrating. Lots of things could have made the stay better and those will be made aware to the management company. Communication with the property manager was great and they checked in with us. There were able to provide a partial refund because of the TV issues.",
